  <layout>Running head at top centre; page number 212 above it. Heading "CAP. XXVIII." with an italic title below. One column of text. A marginal note in the left margin beside the first paragraph.</layout>
  <page_number>212</page_number>
  <running_head>P. VOET</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="28" para="true">CAP. XXVIII.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Utrum duella licentiâ superiorum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>inter socios aut subditos susce-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>pta, sint licita ?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Proclivius est, teste Anna-</l>
    <l n="6">lium scriptore, injuria,</l>
    <l n="7">quam beneficio vicem exolve-</l>
    <l n="8">re: quia gratia oneri, ultio in</l>
    <l n="9">quæstu habetur. Quæ causa</l>
    <l n="10">est, ut ex minimis jurgiis, in-</l>
    <l n="11">juria quavis verbali, duella,</l>
    <l n="12">&amp; hinc homicidia oriantur.</l>
    <l n="13">Nec tantum potuere leges, aut</l>
    <l n="14">edicta, ut non prævaluerint</l>
    <l n="15">vitia, ac depravati hominum</l>
    <l n="16">mores, quibus ad injuriarum</l>
    <l n="17">illatarum vindicationem per</l>
    <l n="18">congressum singularem inci-</l>
    <l n="19">tantur. Qua ratione factum,</l>
    <l n="20">ut necessarium quondam fue-</l>
    <l n="21">rit duella inter subditos per-</l>
    <l n="22">mittere, si quando justæ eorum</l>
    <l n="23">probarentur causæ. Unde li-</l>
    <l n="24">mites ponebantur illimalo in-ve-</l>
  </main_text>
  <marginalia>
    <note side="left" at="Proclivius est, teste" line_from="5" line_to="5">Tacit. Hi-stor,l 4.</note>
  </marginalia>
  <notes>The first letter P is a large initial, joined to the word as "Proclivius". The hyphenated word "in-ve-" runs over the page end and continues on the next page. "illimalo" is printed as it stands and may be a printing error for "illimato". Some letters in the margin note are faint.</notes>
</page>
